{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine the elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element can combine with any other element to create a unique effect or be applied as a debuff.\u00a0 Carry an arsenal of flasks to throw and attune your staff to whichever element you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/821d7c3b7ff86d127af4ef9d79d382b6.poster.avif?t=1774538642\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/821d7c3b7ff86d127af4ef9d79d382b6.webm?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/821d7c3b7ff86d127af4ef9d79d382b6.mp4?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your witch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/2629b632405f6bbdca87412de634daa5.poster.avif?t=1774538642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/2629b632405f6bbdca87412de634daa5.webm?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/2629b632405f6bbdca87412de634daa5.mp4?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control your army of witches...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over the world by moving your armies to control strategic resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/1363e5480592fd04278b24d5f5f8289a.poster.avif?t=1774538642\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/1363e5480592fd04278b24d5f5f8289a.webm?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/1363e5480592fd04278b24d5f5f8289a.mp4?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And then choose a battle to join on the front lines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/82ee847d20f2b2254a28f81a961cb8bf.poster.avif?t=1774538642\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/82ee847d20f2b2254a28f81a961cb8bf.webm?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/82ee847d20f2b2254a28f81a961cb8bf.mp4?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAUSE MAYHEM AND CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture all of the bases or reduce the opponents reinforcements to 0 before they do the same to you.\u00a0 The opening state of the battle depends on how many soldiers you send to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d1a2061feb24669e2bbf2a9cf657b366.poster.avif?t=1774538642\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d1a2061feb24669e2bbf2a9cf657b366.webm?t=1774538642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src